Graphics package selection for the C9 Dell Latitude 5591 profile with Intel
UHD 630, Coffee Lake-H PCI device 8086:3e9b. It supplies the FreeBSD DRM 6.12
driver package and the explicitly selected Kaby Lake firmware family.

The C9 setup utility's intel profile enables i915kms. This metaport does not
configure services or load kernel modules when installed. Graphics acceptance
testing is scoped to the selected Dell model, not every Intel device.
